ttempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10147, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017kvf1QfJX6NYshSw77Tx9H", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 11666, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The service now reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n\nv2.3.0 was the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc failed in staging. Because v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n\nI opened SEV2 incident **INC-0001** for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. The summary describes the v2.3.1 failure and the rollback. It also lists the next step: investigate v2.3.1 before it is released again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01JNaT6BTidw49dho1rHG7Nf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01T17YLRQPPVGc85uV3vBZFv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release now running in all three regions. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NG28vR9VMk9zpDjVjz8WBg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name":